	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## ⚾ MLB Scores — Alfred Workflow

### Usage
| Type this | What you get |
|-----------|-------------|
| `mlb`          | Today's live, upcoming &amp; final scores |
| `mlb {filter}` | Filter today's games by team or status (e.g. `mlb sf`, `mlb live`) |
| `mlbs [query]` | Standings grouped by division (e.g. `mlbs`, `mlbs al east`) |
| `mlbp {name}`  | Player stats (e.g. `mlbp trout`) |
| `mlbt [query]` | Team stats sorted by win % (e.g. `mlbt`, `mlbt dodgers`) |

### mlbt modifier keys
| Key | Shows |
|-----|-------|
| Default | Season record (W-L, GB, Streak, RS/G, RA/G) |
| Hold ⌘ | Team batting (AVG, HR, RBI, OPS, SB) |
| Hold ⌥ | Team pitching (ERA, WHIP, K, SV) |

### Features
- **Dual team logos** — away + home side-by-side for each game
- **Live auto-refresh** — scores update every 5s during live games
- **Player headshots** — live from MLB CDN, cached 7 days locally
- **Timezone** — all game times in your Mac's local timezone automatically
- **No API key** — uses MLB's free official Stats API (statsapi.mlb.com)

Built with ❤️ for Alfred 5.
</string>
